§ `Part VIII -- Publication prohibited (s 276.03)`

-- src:5201 | Exception
-- src:5202 | (1.1) Subsection (1) does not apply if the disclosure of any information referred to in paragraphs (1)(a) to (d) is
-- src:5203 | (a) made in the course of the administration of justice when the purpose of the disclosure is not one of making the information known in the community;
-- src:5204 | (b) made by the complainant or any witness and about that complainant or witness and their particulars, in any forum and for any purpose, and they did not intentionally or recklessly reveal the identity of or reveal particulars likely to identify any other person whose identity is protected by this section; or
-- src:5205 | (c) made by the complainant or any witness when the purpose of the disclosure is not one of making the information known to the public, including when the disclosure is made to a legal professional, a health care professional or a person in a relationship of trust with the complainant or the witness.
@ref Criminal Code s 276.03(1.1) (src:5201-5205)
DECLARE `s 276.03(1.1) facts` HAS
    `the disclosure is made in the course of the administration of justice`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the purpose of the disclosure is not one of making the information known in the community`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the disclosure is made by the complainant or a witness`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the disclosure is about that complainant or witness and their particulars`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the discloser did not intentionally or recklessly reveal the identity of, or particulars likely to identify, any other person whose identity is protected by this section`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the purpose of the disclosure is not one of making the information known to the public`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the disclosure is made to a legal professional, a health care professional or a person in a relationship of trust with the complainant or the witness`   IS A BOOLEAN

